          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Stronger perceived unity and coordination among Western and regional partners (driven by a cohesive response to the Russia‑Ukraine war) raises deterrence costs and coordinated countermeasures, reducing Iran's and its proxies' willingness to initiate or intensify kinetic operations." />
