          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="A rapid increase in available compute capacity accelerates deployment of AI-enabled ISR, real‑time targeting and autonomous systems by state and proxy actors in the region, lowering operational thresholds and increasing the tempo and intensity of kinetic exchanges." />
