          <attvalue for="35" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Sharp increases in deployed or utilized AI compute raise local electricity demand and peak loads, forcing utilities into curtailments, load‑shedding or constrained allocation that reduce reliable grid availability for data centres and nearby users." />
