          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Widening corporate credit spreads constrain financing for producers, traders and refiners (shortening trade finance and inventory funding), forcing cargo delays or shut‑ins that tighten available supply and push up global oil prices." />
