          <attvalue for="29" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Widening corporate and sovereign credit spreads raise financing costs for governments and defence suppliers, constraining budgets and political appetite for sustained material and fiscal support and thereby reducing coalition unity and willingness to coordinate prolonged aid to Ukraine." />
