          <attvalue for="35" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="36" value="Rapid widening of corporate credit spreads raises default and funding stress for large employers and municipalities, producing economic shocks and political crises that force executive emergency responses, cabinet turnover or loss of internal cohesion, undermining executive stability." />
